{
  "description": "Rule 46: CheckOutboundCallStatus in the class's form: no parameters, an Equals condition on each of the page's four statuses in its order, the catch-all, and a NextAction mirroring it; expected accepted. Run on an instance without outbound campaigns, as the sandbox is.",
